title:: BMMIDIBendController
summary:: Documentation BEASTmulch - Generic MIDI Bend Controller	
categories:: Classes

Description::

This class implements a generic controller which receives MIDI pitch bend messages.

See also: link::Classes/Root Classes/BMAbstractController::, link::Classes/Controllers/BMAbstractMIDIController::, link::Classes/Controllers/BMMIDICCController::

CLASSMETHODS::

method:: new
Create a new BMMIDIBendController

argument:: midiport
An instance of link::Classes/Inputs and Outputs/BMMIDIPort::.
argument:: name
A Symbol indicating the name of this controller.
argument:: server
An instance of Server. If you pass nil this will be the default Server.
		
code::
// initialise MIDI ports
BMMIDIPort.init;
// get a port
p = BMMIDIPort.ports['IAC Bus 1'];
b = BMMIDIBendController.new(p, \bendController, s);
		
b.free; // free my resources
::


method:: newFromParamDict
Create a new instance using a parameter dictionary. (See link::Classes/Root Classes/BMAbstractController:: for more information.)

argument:: dict
A Dictionary or subclass with values for the following keys: code::\midiport:: -> An instance of link::Classes/Inputs and Outputs/BMMIDIPort::, code::\name:: -> A Symbol indicating the name of this controller.

argument:: server
An instance of Server. If you pass nil this will be the default Server.


method:: parameterList
See link::Classes/Root Classes/BMAbstractController:: for a discussion of this method. This is the implementation for BMMIDIBendController:
		
code::
*parameterList { 
	var class;
	class = this;
	^(
		name: [Symbol, {class.makeName}, "Name"],
		midiport: [BMMIDIPort, nil, "MIDI Port"]
	); 
}
::


method:: humanName
Returns the String "MIDI Pitchbend Controller".



